                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="Sa5INWEllKiNrZnCJnC0-1" value="1.- Enforce_Invariant_Int / Uint - (INVARIANT_ASKER) - (OK)&#xa;2.- Enforce_Invariant_Add - (INVARIANT_ASKER)&#xa;3.- Enforce_Invariant_Bool - (INVARIANT_ASKER)&#xa;4.- Enforce_Invariant_Bytes32 - (INVARIANT_ASKER)&#xa;&#xa;// Create, Update&#xa;5.- Create_Invariant - (INVARIANT_CONFIGURER) - (OK)&#xa;6.- Update_Invariant - (INVARIANT_CONFIGURER) - (OK)&#xa;&#xa;9.- Disable_Invariant - INVARIANT_CONFIGURER - (OK)&#xa;10.- setConfigurer - onlyOwner  - (OK)&#xa;11.- setAsker - onlyOwner  - (OK)&#xa;12.- setFeetoken - onlyOwner - (OK)&#xa;13.- setFeeAmount - onlyOwner - (OK)&#xa;14.- WithdrawFees - OnlyWithdrawer&#xa;&#xa;" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" parent="glhanbb3aN2LTGsA86wO-5" vertex="1">
